## Index Creation Commands

After creating entity definitions with filtering/sorting, create recommended indexes:

```javascript
// Basic performance indexes
await entityItem.ensureIndex({
  entityDefinitionCode: "productCode",
  indexList: [
    {
      keys: { awid: 1, entityDefinitionCode: 1, name: 1, state: 1 },
      options: { name: "product_name_filter" }
    },
    {
      keys: { awid: 1, entityDefinitionCode: 1, categoryId: 1, state: 1 },
      options: { name: "product_category_filter" }
    },
    {
      keys: { awid: 1, entityDefinitionCode: 1, price: 1 },
      options: { name: "product_price_sort" }
    }
  ]
});
```
